obably be reimplemented with better performance in mind)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114808#pullrequestreview-3645550404","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114808","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-01-09T20:56:37Z"}]